# Code here runs inside other suu-itadm repositories' workflows, with their
# tokens. A change needs a review from someone on the owning team who isn't
# its author, the same rule those repositories apply to their own .github/.
# Later rules win, so keep these specific paths and leave everything else
# unowned.

# Shared actions, such as the review-depth risk tiers.
/actions/               @suu-itadm/itadm-admins

# This repository's own workflows and this file.
/.github/workflows/     @suu-itadm/itadm-admins
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @suu-itadm/itadm-admins
